   "seed": 252956897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1226027821,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How to use it\n1. Duplicate the page shape that fits your screen: List, Detail or Dashboard (laptop and phone).\n2. Fill it by copying pieces from the Pieces frame (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+V). Don't draw your own buttons, tables or cards.\n3. Need something the kit doesn't have? Ask the design reviewer to add it here first, so everyone gets the same one.\n4. Grey only, no colours. Use real sample text: Restaurant-166, User-1a2b3c4d, ₹4,250, 12 Oct.\n5. Draw laptop and phone, plus loading, empty and error states where they apply.\n6. Save as docs/design/<screen>.excalidraw, export docs/design/<screen>.png, open a pull request for the reviewer.\nNames under each piece match the React components in web/src/components/ui.",
   "originalText": "How to use it\n1. Duplicate the page shape that fits your screen: List, Detail or Dashboard (laptop and phone).\n2. Fill it by copying pieces from the Pieces frame (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+V). Don't draw your own buttons, tables or cards.\n3. Need something the kit doesn't have? Ask the design reviewer to add it here first, so everyone gets the same one.\n4. Grey only, no colours. Use real sample text: Restaurant-166, User-1a2b3c4d, ₹4,250, 12 Oct.\n5. Draw laptop and phone, plus loading, empty and error states where they apply.\n6. Save as docs/design/<screen>.excalidraw, export docs/design/<screen>.png, open a pull request for the reviewer.\nNames under each piece match the React components in web/src/components/ui.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
